00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:26.750
I didn't quite catch that.

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:29.830
Goodbye, Kamogawa

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:27.790
How about you, Lan?

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:28.710
Same.

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:30.250
Oh well...

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:31.960
Okay, I'll tell you again.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:38.260
These are the groups that the Jersey Club helped out for this year's Oraga Festival.

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:40.380
Which means...

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:45.390
all of them fall under our club's exhibit!

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:48.270
Oh, I see.

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.520
How did you come to that conclusion?

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:54.610
There's no point in trying to reason with Madoka.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:59.740
And now, the Jersey Club will proceed to check out all our exhibits!

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:15.210
Madoka, do we have to wear these jerseys?

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.210
We're the Jersey Club!

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:19.300
This is our uniform.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:28.060
Where jersey is master, skirt is servant.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.060
Huh?

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:37.820
Was that a joke just now?

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:39.280
Forget it!

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:41.990
Lan, wait!

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:46.620
Shouldn't we tell Madoka?

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:51.250
<i>We will confront the next enemy attack with just the two of you.</i>

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:54.710
<i>Make sure Kyouno doesn't know about this.</i>

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.800
I think Mr. Tadokoro is right.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:02.800
That old man can be quite thoughtful at times.

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:05.680
What are you whispering about?

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.180
Tell me too!

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:09.220
It's a secret.

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.770
Huh? Lan, you're so mean!

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:15.100
Forget about that meanie Lan, let's just go!

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.150
Huh? Huh?!

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:19.070
Muginami, don't pull!

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:22.360
The live concert starts in the afternoon.

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:25.280
Then let's check out the haunted house first!

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:26.240
<i>Sounds good!</i>

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:27.990
<i>But I'm also kind of hungry.</i>

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:29.950
I wonder if people will come to our cafe?

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:31.790
Don't worry.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:34.500
You look perfect in that costume, Michi. Have confidence!

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.710
You're so lucky, Sachi.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:40.250
The Surf Club attracts a lot of attention because you won the prefectural competition.

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:42.010
Well, that's true.

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:03.440
What will we do?

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:04.860
I'm going.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:08.530
There's no way I'll let Le Garite have the Vox.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:10.080
I'm not going.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:13.040
Fine, I didn't expect anything from you anyway.

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:17.580
Fighting the Chairman and the people of this planet

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.420
just doesn't sit right with me.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:24.220
That girl has got you on her leash, that's all.

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:24.630
What?

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:28.260
So is that the extent of your feelings towards Yurikano?

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:31.390
Is that supposed to be a bad joke?

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:37.390
Just what did Yurikano envision for us?

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:40.270
When we first came to this planet,

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:43.730
I was determined to accomplish our goal at all costs.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:50.660
But would Yurikano really want us to fight to avenge her death?

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:52.410
That's...

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:57.500
Is revenge worth the sacrifice of so many lives?

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:04.670
Wouldn't Yurikano's greatest wish be to stop the Vox from causing any more suffering?

