00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.210
I hate this! I'm leaving!

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:44.500
I want to go home, Brother!

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.380
Lan, are you all right?

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:48.670
Sorry about that.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.220
Welcome!

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.890
Care to try some corn on the cob?

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:57.520
"I'm leaving! I want to go home, Brother!"

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:01.270
Lan, your eyes are all red!

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:05.070
You're so mean!

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:07.780
Here!

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:10.280
Eat this and cheer up.

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:20.460
There are so many people...

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:24.210
I was so touched.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:25.090
Me too.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:26.800
Especially that last scene, where...

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:28.670
What? Is that you, Madoka?

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:35.100
No way...

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.970
What a transformation.

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:38.970
Oh, Madoka!

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:41.270
It's amazing! It's a huge hit!

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:42.600
And it's all thanks to you.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:44.730
Oh, it's nothing.

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:47.270
I must say, when the lead actress is attractive,

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:49.820
the rest of the film just follows suit...

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:53.780
Oh, who are these two?

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:56.370
Huh? Oh, they're members of my club.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:57.280
Marvelous!

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:02.330
Please! You must both take part in our next film!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:03.420
"Take part"?

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:09.510
Oh, just looking at you all together gets my creative juices flowing!

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:11.010
Right...

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:15.890
Let's see... Where to next?

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:17.300
Would you like to take a picture?

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:20.520
We'll print it right out for you.

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:28.400
Can you crouch down a little more?

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:45.420
Wow, she's amazing!

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:47.380
All her shots are double taps!

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:49.290
Raise the level of difficulty!

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:51.380
This barely counts as practice.

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.630
Asteria?

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:56.430
Ah, there you are.

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:03.560
This Japanese carnival is not as spectacular as I had imagined.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:05.810
Well, this is a high school {cultural }festival.

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:08.610
Asteria, what are you doing here?

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:09.480
Well...

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:10.400
Lan!

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:12.280
I found you at last!

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:13.190
Sachi?

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:16.320
Our club is in trouble! Please help us!

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:18.280
Huh? But...

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:19.950
Go, Lan.

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:22.410
That's Jersey Club's duty in the Oraga Festival!

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:24.540
Okay.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:27.460
Thanks, Madoka. We owe you one!

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:32.500
Wow, I didn't know Lan and Sachi were such good friends.

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:35.470
They are. You didn't know?

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:37.010
Muginami!

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:37.720
Yes?

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:40.100
Oh Michi, what is it?

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:44.220
I'm sorry, but would you mind helping us?

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:47.100
We're shorthanded at the Astronomy Club's café.

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:50.810
They need you, Muginami.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:52.150
Go and help them.

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:53.650
Roger that!

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:54.610
Let's go!

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:56.490
Thanks, Muginami!

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:01.120
Well...

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:06.120
What should we do?

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:21.600
What is that? It smells good.

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:27.100
Oh... Those are grilled eels.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:30.150
Eels... Did you say eels?!

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:31.860
They're swimming around in there.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:36.360
Th-This is...!

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:38.780
You actually eat those things?

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:43.620
Such a huge, black... and slimy...

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:48.290
What is this? It's unforgivable!

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:50.080
How can eel taste so good?

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:52.170
Why wasn't I ever told?!

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:55.250
You should be upset or eat.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:57.300
Do one at a time.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:10:59.880
Kyouno Madoka!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:00.840
Y-Yes!

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:05.310
Bring me all the dishes that are being served at this carnival!

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:06.720
What?!

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:09.430
The world is so cruel.

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:14.310
Why is it that the unhealthier the food looks, the better it tastes?

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.610
You're being melodramatic.

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:18.690
Listen carefully, Madoka.

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:24.200
The human body is made up of what you eat.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:27.490
Our hearts and minds cannot work if we don't have a body.

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:28.330
Okay...?

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:31.330
To eat is to live.

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:37.590
We are linked to the universe by the food we eat, the water we drink and the air we breathe.

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:43.090
To put something into our mouths means to take in the universe into our bodies.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:49.060
Huh?!

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:51.810
Let's go.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:57.190
What? Umm...

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:00.110
Thank you for waiting.

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:02.990
Our planetarium show is about to start!

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:04.320
The room will darken,

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:06.910
so please hang on to your belongings and watch your step.

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.790
Wow!

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:17.170
It's amazing...

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:17.170
So pretty...

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:20.670
You were a huge help, Muginami.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:21.630
Thank you!

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:24.220
<i>Yes, coming right away!</i>

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:25.550
<i>Yes, please wait just a moment!</i>

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:29.220
I know quite a bit about stars.

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:30.970
Really?

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:32.180
Yeah!

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:35.270
Then why don't you join the Astronomy Club, Muginami?

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:41.070
But I'm an alien.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:44.110
We're going to do the Planetarium Cafe again next year.

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:45.860
So please join!

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:47.450
I don't know...

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:50.240
Aren't you going in?

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:53.000
They seem busy. I'll try later.

