00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:01.420
Even though we used the ultimate weapon,

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:03.340
Heaven has forsaken us...

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:06.010
Ultimate weapon? Is that me?

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.180
That's right!

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:11.100
You may not have noticed, 
but you're quite popular, Lan.

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:28.120
A

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:28.120
Welcome to 
the Surf Club

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:12.350
Popular?

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:15.520
I was so sure that if you wore a wetsuit,

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:18.110
we'd have a flood of customers.

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:21.020
I was too optimistic.

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:25.200
I can't attract customers when I can't even swim.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:28.120
What? You were worried about that?

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:35.120
Then I'll teach you how to swim next time.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:36.960
Really?

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.380
Yeah. In appreciation for helping me!

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.440
Madoka...

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:07.570
Kyouno Madoka.

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:15.330
Whoa!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:18.750
What were you thinking?

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:21.380
Huh?

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:31.930
I should be happy seeing Lan and Muginami 
making new friends and having fun...

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:34.680
But instead, I'm feeling a bit depressed.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:41.900
I was all by myself at last year's school festival though,

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:44.270
so I wonder why?

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:53.490
I see, understood.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.040
That was Tadokoro.

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:03.960
A large number of artificial objects have been spotted approaching Earth at a high speed.

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:14.760
Pharos is...

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:17.770
It's moving into battle position,

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:20.730
to keep this town out of harm's way.

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:22.600
I have to go!

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:24.690
To do what?

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.020
With Midori, I can...!

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:30.200
There is nothing you can do.

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:32.240
But Lan and Muginami are...

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:35.240
Those two are already on their way to Pharos.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.080
That's...

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:46.000
Tadokoro ordered them to keep the assault a secret from you.

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.090
What?

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:50.090
He acted under my orders.

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:03.060
<i>No!</i>

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.650
<i>It can't be true!</i>

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:17.120
We'll be off.

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:17.490
Lan\h\h \hMuginami

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:17.240
We'll be off.

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:17.370
We'll be off.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:17.490
We'll be off.

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:17.740
We'll be off.

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:17.740
Lan\h\h \hMuginami

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:24.120
Up until now,

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:26.500
you've run the Jersey Club all by yourself.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:30.300
But now, you have Lan and Muginami.

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:36.970
You've learned that they spend time on their own and could experience joy without you.

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:38.310
That's why you got upset.

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:43.020
You're remembering the fear of losing someone.

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:55.660
Do you think Madoka is mad at us?

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:00.660
This was the only way to protect Madoka.

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:04.870
I guess we can't have Aura act up like the last time.

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:08.420
We made our choice.

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:11.420
To protect Madoka along with this town.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:14.930
Do you mean, protect Kamogawa together with Madoka?

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:18.390
Or protect both Madoka and this town?

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.640
Both.

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.390
That's for sure.

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:27.270
Madoka!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.400
Youko filled me in the situation!

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:31.690
She did?

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:33.320
You're going to sea, right?

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:36.530
My dad's boat is in the harbor. Use it!

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:39.370
Sachi... Thank you!

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:47.000
To fight is to face the fear of losing something precious.

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:50.500
Are you prepared to confront that fear?

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:57.010
Lan! Muginami!

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:58.300
I'm...

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:01.220
I'm coming too!

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:12.860
You should have told me you were here.

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:16.190
They actually got a clubhouse?

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:17.150
Those damn kids.

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:20.740
Back in my day, we had to do without a room.

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:23.910
Are you sure about letting Madoka go?

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:26.960
I couldn't have stopped her even if I wanted to.

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:28.920
She's just like her mother.

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:34.210
I think you're more fixated on that than Madoka.

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:42.220
I just couldn't throw it away.

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:45.220
Machiko!

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:55.230
<i>Commencing transport to the catapult deck.</i>

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:57.940
<i>Lympha now entering T.O. sequence.</i>

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:01.110
<i>Ignis now entering T.O. sequence.</i>

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:03.950
<i>Commencing Vox Ignis A.I Remote System check.</i>

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:05.910
We're really going to have to fight Brother this time, aren't we?

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:06.620
<i>Probably.</i>

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:11.750
If I hesitate again, Lan...

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:15.250
<i>If you do, I'll smack you.</i>

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:17.090
How scary!

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:19.130
Lan, you sound like Madoka.

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:21.800
That's right.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:24.220
After all, we're...

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:24.220
<i>Opening the top hatch.</i>

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:25.310
the Jersey Club.

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:26.220
Yes, we are.

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:28.100
<i>Vox Lympha is on deck.</i>

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.930
<i>Vox Ignis is on deck.</i>

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:32.520
<i>Vox Lympha, Vox Ignis... cleared for take off.</i>

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:34.150
Let's go, Orca!

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:36.360
Okay! We're off!

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.400
Let's give it our all, Hupo!

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:53.330
What's the status of the Le Garite armada?

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:57.130
<i>We lured them into the Starburst Region of the Thaddeus Nebula.</i>

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:59.340
<i>It will be difficult for them to escape from there.</i>

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:02.380
Good work. What are our losses?

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:05.800
<i>The high speed cruiser Forzellhind was destroyed.</i>

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:08.430
<i>The artillery ship, Dahhau II, sustained serious damage.</i>

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:11.060
<i>Ten Ovids were lost as well.</i>

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:13.560
That's less than our initial estimates.

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:17.150
But higher than my hypothesis.

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:18.360
I miscalculated.

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:21.950
<i>You're too rigid with your estimates, Grania.</i>

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:24.490
We are not the military.

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:27.580
Stay on course to enter orbit.

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:30.290
Operations will begin shortly.

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:34.250
<i>Are you sure about this?</i>

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:37.630
I'm sorry for what I'm about to make you go through...

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:38.710
<i>It's all right.</i>

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:42.550
Have you decided what to do?

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:44.880
We're coming.

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:46.300
However...

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:49.680
We're not following you.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:52.270
We're following Yurikano.

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:53.520
Huh?

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:00.650
Do as you please.

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:04.150
I'm amazed that you kept it.

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:07.030
Shall we do it, for old times' sake?

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:08.120
Today?

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:09.660
Sure. It's the festival!

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:12.330
Do we have time to prep it?

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:16.250
A school teacher has quite a bit of influence, you know.

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:26.090
What you do want to do, Madoka?

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:27.800
Should I head back to shore?

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:32.680
Please don't go back.

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:33.430
What?

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:37.060
I've...

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:40.940
decided to go!

